�Sugkhrone Irlandia, etos 2005. O Tzeri Phegkan einai enas ektelestes tou IRA pou edrase gia skhedon trianta khronia. Sta saranta pente tou khronia einai alkoolikos kai mallon psukhika diataragmenos. Dodeka phantasmata palaion thumaton tou -isos ton pio apotropaion kai adikon dolophonion pou diepraxe- ton kunegoun kai tou miloun se mia mustike glossa deikhnontas tou pos mporei na exileothei.
Sten anazetese loipon tes lutroses o Tzeri tha prokhoresei ston aphanismo oson dietaxan e etan oi ethikoi autourgoi ton sugkekrimenon dolophonion. E ekdikese pou pairnei gia kathena apo ta thumata isoutai me ten apomakrunse enos phantasmatos.
Ola auta sumbainoun eno ste Boreia Irlandia einai se exelixe oi eireneutikes diapragmateuseis kai oi phonoi autoi apeiloun na tis tinaxoun ston aera."�
�"Ta biblia pou ekhoume anagke einai ekeina pou pephtoun san to tsekouri sten pagomene thalassa tes psukhes mas" egraphe o Kaphka ston Oskar Pollak liga khronia prin apo te suggraphe tes "Metamorphoses", enos ergou pou anekei khoris amphibolia akribos s' aute ten kategoria biblion. E "Metamorphose" graphteke to 1912 kai kuklophorese to 1916 -ena apo ta liga erga tou Tsekhou suggraphea pou ekdothekan oso ekeinos zouse.
O purenas tou muthou tes "Metamorphoses" einai toso aplos oso kai asulleptos: o Gkregkor Samsa, enas sunethismenos anthropos, xupnaei ena proi metamorphomenos se entomo. Me aute te base kai mesa apo ta matia tou eroa-entomou, o Kaphka stenei mia kathara realistike istoria, ena apolutos pisteuta psukhologiko peirama, pou upogrammizetai apo plethos odunera eustokhon leptomereion sten perigraphe prosopon kai pragmaton. Aristotekhnika o Kaphka okhi mono xetuligei tis agonies, tis enokhes kai ten allotriose tou sugkhronou anthropou, alla phtanei kai na metaphrasei aute ten akhare kai anousia uparxe se ule, se somatike upostase."�
�Ola ekhoun teleiosei gia ton Saimon Axler, ton protagoniste tou sunarpastikou neou bibliou tou Philip Roth. Koruphaios ethopoios tou amerikanikou theatrou epi dekaeties, anakaluptei oti sta exenta tou khronia ekhei apolesei to talento tou, ten autopepoithese tou, ten ikanoteta tou na sageneuei. O Phalstaph, o Peer Gkunt, o Banias, oloi oi megaloi tou roloi "ekhoun liosei ki eginan anemos, diaphanos anemos". Otan anebainei ste skene, aisthanetai san paraphronas kai sumperipheretai san elithios. E empistosune stis dunameis tou ekhei khathei* phantazetai oti to koino tou ton loidorei kai ton khleuazei* den katorthonei pia na upokrithei peistika oti einai kapoios allos. "Kati themeliodes ekhei exanemistei". E suzugos tou ekhei phugei, to koino tou ton ekhei egkataleipsei, o atzentes tou den mporei na ton peisei na xanagurisei sto theatro.
Mesa s' aute ten anexegete kai tromaktike apogumnose pou genna ston Axler skepseis autoktonias, eisballei, san paregoria, mia anapantekhe erotike epithumia. Ostoso, einai se tetoio bathmo ripsokindune kai asunethiste oste den odegei se anakouphise kai eudaimonia, alla se ena akome pio zophero kai sugklonistiko telos. S' auto to makru taxidi tes meras mesa ste nukhta, to opoio aphegeitai o Roth me ten amimete amesoteta tou, me tolme, sobaroteta alla kai sarkasmo, ola ta mesa pou epistrateuoume prokeimenou na peistoume gia te statheroteta kai ten antokhe mas, ola ta epiteugmata tes zoes mas -talento, erotas, sex, elpida, energeia,pheme- kataluontai.
Epekteinontas tous zopherous stokhasmous tou pano ste thnetoteta kai to telos ("Kathenas", "Pheugei to phantasma") kai ten pikra eironike anadrome ste neoteta kai tis khamenes tes eukairies ("Aganaktese"), o Roth ekhei grapsei allo ena basanistiko, diauges, oma eilikrines biblio, sto klima ton teleutaion tou ergon."�
�Oi "Anamneseis apo to spiti ton pethamenon" tou Phiontor Ntostogiebske einai to muthistorema pou xeskepazei ta apanthropa tsarika katerga, opos to katergo tou Omsk sten anatolike Siberia. To katergo, opou ki o idios o suggrapheas ezese me xurismeno to kephali, me ta podia alusodemena kai me monadike tou suntrophia ten Agia Graphe* to katergo, opou upephere epi tessera khronia tromera basanisteria kai exeutelismous. Ena drimu kategoro, pou ekphrazei tautokhrona te phlogere agape tou Ntostogiebske gia te laike Rosia, gia tous aplous anthropous."�
�Liga amerikanika biblia eginan thrulos oso to "En psukhro".
H muthistorematike aute aphegese mias pragmatikes istorias -tes agrias dolophonias tessaron melon mias oikogeneias sto Kansas, tes ereunas pou akolouthese gia ten aneurese ton draston, tes sullepses kai tes ekteleses tous- sunarpase apo ten arkhe ten kritike kai to anagnostiko koino tes epokhes. Auto to "non fiction novel", saranta khronia meta (opos apedeixe e kinematographike tainia "Kapote", tes opoias kentriko thema einai akribos to pos o suggrapheas proseggise to uliko tou, gnorizontas apo konta tous dolophonous se mia polusuzetemene, amphirrope kai idiazousa skhese), exakolouthei na theoreitai to aristourgema tou Trouman Kapote, ena apo ta semantikotera biblia tou 20ou aiona.
Se nea, egkure metaphrase.
"Ena aristourgema... ena sunarpastiko biblio".
(periodiko "Life")"�
�To Mustiko klerodotetheke mesa apo tous aiones, kai etan polloi ekeinoi pou to pothesan, to epibouleutekan, to eklepsan kai to agorasan me antitimo terastia khrematika posa. Auto to proaionio Mustiko etan prosbasimo se kapoious anthropous --epheuretes, epistemones, theologous, epikheirematies, stokhastes, kallitekhnes-- ki anamesa se autous pou katanoesan te thaumatourge duname tou sugkatalegontai istorikes prosopikotetes opos o Platonas, o Galilaios, o Mpetoben, o Entison, o Karnegki, o Ainstain, o Mpleik. Tora to Mustiko apokaluptetai se olo ton kosmo.
Apo to opisthophullo tou bibliou"�
�E Phaidra ki o Odusseas einai duo neoi sta dekaokhto tous khronia. Ekeine spoudazei theatrologos, autos mathematika kai mousike. E Phaidra ki o Odusseas tha eroteutoun o enas ton allon. O erotas tous omos de tha einai mia anephele periodos tes zoes tous, alla e tragike stigme duo neon anthropon pou briskontai antimetopoi me ten adusopete parousia tou AIDS."�
�"'Erthes kai xaploses sta podia mou, to teleutaio ekeino mesemeri, esukha, adiamartureta, truphera. Mou eipes khoris phone to teleutaio antio. M' apokhaireteses, me to soma sou. Mono pou ego den to katalaba tote. Koimethekes ligo ap' ten alle meria tes kardias sou. Auto etan to teleutaio mas agkaliasma. E teleutaia phora pou ta somata mas aggikhtekan. Den eipes tipota. M' apokhaireteses me ton tropo sou, eugenika, oraia. To logiko sou den epiane to menuma gia na mou to ekphraseis. Ma oute sou aresan oi melodramatismoi. 'Ena bathu eukharisto mou eipe to kormi sou, pou eikosi khronia alle den gnorise ap' ten agkalia mou"."�
�Ti einai ekeino pou kanei auto to muthistorema gia to Aousbits toso blasphemo; Na einai o athoos kai aisiodoxos tropos enos nearou Ebraiou pou diegeitai ton ektopismo tou os ena taxidi sto agnosto kai ten aphixe tou sto Aousbits os ena paraxeno theama; Mepos e blasphemia egkeitai sto gegonos oti katanoei me tose prothumia te logike ton stratopedon - enas eumathes mathetes pou thelei na kanei te douleia tou oso to dunaton kalutera;
To muthistorema enos anthropou dikhos pepromeno den einai mono to "diastrophiko" aristourgema tou megalou nompelista Ouggrou suggraphea alla kai ena apo ta semantikotera biblia tou 20ou aiona."�	
�	To mikro idiokteto megaro, ste gonia tes odou kai tes gephuras Des Grands-Augustins einai tou 15ou aiona. Mou etan ede gnoste e katoikia eupatridon tou 17ou aiona, ston arithmo 7, kathos kai oi duo teleutaioi orophoi pou eikhan ginei to atelie tou Pikasso. Prin ap auton, ekei mesa ekane probes se theatrika erga o Jean-Louis Barrault, pou upedeixe autous tous periergous diathesimous khorous ston Pikasso, ki autos deleasteke amesos. Ena delear autou tou spitiou : edo eikhe topothetesei o Mpalzak to Agnosto Aristourgema tou. S auto edo to spiti ebaze ton maitr Frenhofer na sunantietai me ton Franz Porbus kai ton Nicolas Poussin* edo mesa o eroas tou aphegematos tou, pou e dipsa tou gia to apoluto ton apomakrune olo kai perissotero ap ten anaparastase tes phuses, demiourgese kai katestrepse to aristourgema tou, kai pethane... Alloste, o tropos me ton opoio perigraphei o Mpalzak auto to spiti, ten apotome kai skoteine skala, antapokrinetai arketa entuposiaka sto pos einai semera o khoros. O Pikasso, sugkinemenos kai erethismenos ap ten idea na parei te these tes phemismenes skias tou Frenhofer, noikiase amesos to atelie. Auto egine to 1937. Kai sto idio meros pou graphteke to Agnosto Aristourgema, zographise to "pasignosto aristourgema" : ten Gkouernika.."�
�Selected & Introduced by David Stuart Davies.
Traumatised by ghost stories in her youth, Pulitzer Prize winning author Edith Wharton (1862 -1937) channelled her fear and obsession into creating a series of spine-tingling tales filled with spirits beyond the grave and other supernatural phenomena. While claiming not to believe in ghosts, paradoxically she did confess that she was frightened of them. Wharton imbues this potent irrational and imaginative fear into her ghostly fiction to great effect.
In this unique collection of finely wrought tales Wharton demonstrates her mastery of the ghost story genre. Amongst the many supernatural treats within these pages you will encounter a married farmer bewitched by a dead girl; a ghostly bell which saves a woman's reputation; the weird spectral eyes which terrorise the midnight hours of an elderly aesthete; the haunted man who receives letters from his dead wife; and the frightening power of a doppelganger which foreshadows a terrible tragedy.
Compelling, rich and strange, the ghost stories of Edith Wharton, like vintage wine, have matured and grown more potent with the passing years."�
�Opos o nautes sta xartia glistrese pano ston tropiko
tou Karkinou kai ston tropiko tou Aigokero
ki etan polu phusiko pou den mporouse na stamatesei
mprosta mas sto upsos anthropou
alla mas koitaze olous apo to upsos tes pugolampidas
e apo to upsos tou peukou
pairnontas bathia ten anasa tou ste drosia ton astron
e ste skone tes ges.
Ton peristoikhizan gumnes gunaikes me mprountzina phulla
araposukias
sbesmenoi phanostates anemizontas tous kelidomenous
epidesmous tes megales politeias
asummetra kormia gennobolontas kentaurous kai amazones
san aggizan ta mallia tous to Galaxia.
(Giorgos Sepheres apospasma apo to poiema "Les Anges sont blancs", aphieromeno ston Khenri Miler).
To aristourgema tou Khenri Miler, ena muthistorema pou exakolouthei na skandalizei. O suggrapheas periplanietai sto phantasmagoriko Parisi tou Mesopolemou kai mesa apo polles mikres kai megales peripeteies kai spartaristes erotikes drasteriotetes anakaluptei ton idio tou ton eauto kai to bathutero pseudos tou kosmou pou ton periballei."�
�O Paskoual Ntouarte kai e oikogeneia tou einai ta tragika thumata mias koinonikopolitikes domes pou agnoei ton idio ton anthropo, pou ton aphenei sten tukhe tou kai sten tukhe enos anuparktou Theou o opoios, par' ola auta, despozei mes sto mualo tou kai katatrekhei ten kathe tou praxe. O Theos sugkheetai me te moira: o,ti einai graphto na ginei tha sumbei, kai gi' auto den einai kanenas upeuthunos. Mono pou telika autos pou tha plerosei einai o idios o Paskoual Ntouarte kai e oikogeneia tou.
Otan, sta 1942, ekdotheke E oikogeneia tou Paskoual Ntouarte, mia nea othese dotheke sten ispanike logotekhnia: xanagurise s' enan kosmo laiko kai agrotiko, pou oi kharakteres tou etan anthropoi protogonoi ki authentikoi. Sta agria pathe kai sta aploika enstikta tous, o kosmos olokleros eide ten parabole mias khoras sten opoia anakuklonetai sunekhos e barbaroteta, e bia, to misos kai to aima."	
